#. column 11: Coward's Knife
#. column 12: Damage Dealt +1%<br>35% chance to offer escape from an enemy space, thus avoiding battle and forfeiting loot. Ineffective on elite enemy or boss spaces.<br>Grants one stack of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Guerrilla Tactics</ui-edge-color></ui-color> upon fleeing.<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Guerrilla Tactics Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases damage dealt by 18% and evasion by 4%
