msgctxt "XBMItem:86:0:12"
msgid "Increases poison resistance by 100% for self or familiar.<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 180s<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> When carrying a crimson ribbon, restores 50% of target's total HP<br>※Can only be used on Crucible battlegrounds."
