msgid "Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Through Fire</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to self and nearby allies.<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Through Fire Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 50% chance to absorb fire damage as HP<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s<br>※Can only be used on Crucible battlegrounds."
